    "output": {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " 380→\t\tscheduleRoutine: (routineId) => routineEngine().ensureScheduled(routineId),\n 381→\t\t// 会话考古（2026-11-09 T4 §4）：默认开；AGENT_RECALL_SESSIONS=false → 不传，\n 382→\t\t// `recall_sessions` 整块不注册（模型侧 tool_unavailable，一行回滚）。\n 383→\t\t// 用 getHarness() 惰性取：createTools 执行时 harness 还没 open，真正调用时已就绪。\n 384→\t\trecallSessions: recallSessionsEnabled()\n 385→\t\t\t? (query, options) =>\n 386→\t\t\t\t\tgetHarness().then((harness) => searchSessions(harness, query, options))\n 387→\t\t\t: null,\n 388→\t\t// persona-metric 记忆库检索（2026-11-09 persona 接入批一，方案 D-甲/D-乙/D-己）：\n 389→\t\t// `PERSONA_MEMORY_ASK` 配置 = 启用（默认未配置 = 工具不上架）；`PERSONA_MEMORY_ENABLED=false`\n 390→\t\t// = 显式关。双闸都过才注入，`persona_recall` 才注册（模型侧 tool_unavailable，一行回滚）。\n 391→\t\t// 本批只走按需工具，不进 recallContext / buildContext 的每轮注入链。\n 392→\t\tpersonaAsk:\n 393→\t\t\tpersonaAskEnabled() && askPersonaAvailable()\n 394→\t\t\t\t? (question, options) => askPersona(question, options)\n 395→\t\t\t\t: null,\n 396→\t});\n 397→\tregistry.install(\n 398→\t\t(lifediaryExt = defineExtension({\n 399→\t\t\tname: \"lifediary\",\n 400→\t\t\ttools: lifediaryTools,\n 401→\t\t\tsections: [\n 402→\t\t\t\t// 人格（2026-11-06 B2 改为按会话种类分流）：\n 403→\t\t\t\t//  - 非 chief 的执事会话 → 不注入总管 persona（身份来自其 configure instructions）；\n 404→\t\t\t\t//  - worker → 独立的普通任务助手提示；\n 405→\t\t\t\t//  - chief / 无记录旧会话 → 总管 SOUL 当前版本快照，读不到回落原 PERSONA 常量。\n 406→\t\t\t\t{\n 407→\t\t\t\t\tkey: \"persona\",\n 408→\t\t\t\t\trender: async (input) => {\n 409→\t\t\t\t\t\tif (COMPANIONS_ENABLED) {\n 410→\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttry {\n 411→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tconst partnerId = partnersStore().partnerIdOfSession(Number(input.conversationId));\n 412→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (partnerId && partnerId !== CHIEF_PARTNER_ID) return undefined;\n 413→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t} catch {\n 414→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 档案库读失败：按总管处理，主对话不能哑\n 415→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n 416→\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n 417→\t\t\t\t\t\tconst kinds = await input.read.snapshot(ChatKinds, CTX);\n 418→\t\t\t\t\t\tif (kinds?.byInternal?.[String(input.conversationId)] === \"worker\") return WORKER_PERSONA;\n 419→\t\t\t\t\t\treturn resolvePersona(partnersStore, PERSONA);\n 420→\t\t\t\t\t},\n 421→\t\t\t\t},\n 422→\t\t\t\t// 注入防线（2026-11-09 T2）：紧跟在 persona 之后，固定字节、不含动态内容。\n 423→\t\t\t\t// 关掉时整段省略（不注空壳）。\n 424→\t\t\t\t{\n 425→\t\t\t\t\tkey: \"injection_guard\",\n 426→\t\t\t\t\trender: () => (injectionGuardEnabled() ? INJECTION_GUARD : undefined),\n 427→\t\t\t\t},\n 428→\t\t\t\t// 当前项目（2026-11-04 方案 §2.3）：每轮现渲染，不写进对话历史。\n 429→\t\t\t\t// 切换项目后 durable 会按 section 差异追加新的 pi.system，下一轮即生效。\n 430→\t\t\t\t{\n 431→\t\t\t\t\tkey: \"current_project\",\n 432→\t\t\t\t\trender: () => {\n 433→\t\t\t\t\t\tif (!currentProjectEnabled()) return undefined;\n 434→\t\t\t\t\t\tconst project = currentProject();\n 435→\t\t\t\t\t\tif (!project) return \"当前无特定项目（杂事模式）。文件操作默认在主工作区。\";\n 436→\t\t\t\t\t\treturn [\n 437→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t`当前项目：${project.name}`,\n 438→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t`根路径：${project.rootPath}`,\n 439→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"文件操作默认在此项目内。\",\n 440→\t\t\t\t\t\t].join(\"\\n\");\n 441→\t\t\t\t\t},\n 442→\t\t\t\t},\n 443→\t\t\t\t// L1 技能索引（2026-10-31 方案 D5）：排在 persona 后（\"会话后部\"），按会话冻结——\n 444→\t\t\t\t// 首轮渲染后技能目录再变也不改写本会话，否则 durable 会追加新 pi.system、缓存前缀整段作废。\n 445→\t\t\t\t// 没有技能时 render 返回 undefined，整个 section 省略。\n 446→\t\t\t\t{\n 447→\t\t\t\t\tkey: \"skills\",\n 448→\t\t\t\t\trender: (input) => skillStore?.indexFor(Number(input.conversationId)),\n 449→\t\t\t\t},\n 450→\t\t\t\t// 课题（2026-11-07 长期课题跟进 §六）：清单 + 嗅探判据 + 攒着的简报。\n 451→\t\t\t\t// **每轮现渲染**（durable 只在 section 值变化时追加 pi.system）：\n 452→\t\t\t\t//   - 只给总管主对话：非 chief 执事 / worker / 群会话一律 undefined；\n 453→\t\t\t\t//   - 有 pendingPush 的课题在这里把简报带进本轮，并**渲染即标记已推送**\n 454→\t\t\t\t//     （每课题每次活跃只报一次；研究专线摘掉了本扩展，不会误触）；\n 455→\t\t\t\t//   - 没有在跟的课题也输出判据段，让总管知道\"有这个口\"。\n 456→\t\t\t\t{\n 457→\t\t\t\t\tkey: \"topics\",\n 458→\t\t\t\t\trender: async (input) => {\n 459→\t\t\t\t\t\tif (!TOPICS_ENABLED) return undefined;\n 460→\t\t\t\t\t\tconst conversationId = Number(input.conversationId);\n 461→\t\t\t\t\t\tif (COMPANIONS_ENABLED) {\n 462→\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttry {\n 463→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (partnersStore().isGroupSession(conversationId)) return undefined;\n 464→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tconst partnerId = partnersStore().partnerIdOfSession(conversationId);\n 465→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (partnerId && partnerId !== CHIEF_PARTNER_ID) return undefined;\n 466→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t} catch {\n 467→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 档案库读失败：按总管处理（主对话不能哑，与 persona 同口径）\n 468→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n 469→\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n 470→\t\t\t\t\t\tconst kinds = await input.read.snapshot(ChatKinds, CTX);\n 471→\t\t\t\t\t\tif (kinds?.byInternal?.[String(conversationId)] === \"worker\") return undefined;\n 472→\n 473→\t\t\t\t\t\tconst store = topicsStore();\n 474→\t\t\t\t\t\tconst pushes = store.drainPendingPushes();\n 475→\t\t\t\t\t\tconst digest = store.digestForInjection();\n 476→\t\t\t\t\t\tconst lines: string[] = [];\n 477→\t\t\t\t\t\tif (digest) {\n 478→\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlines.push(\"在跟的课题：\", digest);\n 479→\t\t\t\t\t\t} else {\n 480→"
