能哑\n 877→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tconsole.warn(\n 878→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t`[partner] 会话 ${api.conversationId} 上下文装配失败: ${\n 879→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\terror instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error)\n 880→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}`,\n 881→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t);\n 882→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n 883→\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n 884→\n 885→",
