s.db\n 242→\t\t\t.prepare(\n 243→\t\t\t\t\"INSERT INTO delegation_receipts (request_id, ticket_id, fingerprint, outcome, boot_id, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (?, '', ?, 'accepting', ?, ?, ?)\",\n 244→\t\t\t)\n 245→\t\t\t.run(requestId, fingerprint, BOOT_ID, now, now);\n 246→\t}\n 247→\n 248→\tprivate reinsert(requestId: string, fingerprint: string): void {\n 249→\t\tconst now = new Date().toISOString();\n 250→\t\tthis.db\n 251→\t\t\t.prepare(\n 252→\t\t\t\t\"UPDATE delegation_receipts SET ticket_id = '', fingerprint = ?, outcome = 'accepting', boot_id = ?, updated_at = ? WHERE request_id = ?\",\n 253→\t\t\t)\n 254→\t\t\t.run(fingerprint, BOOT_ID, now, requestId);\n 255→\t}\n 256→\n 257→\t// ── 死信（A2 补差）────────────────────────────────────\n 258→\t/**\n 259→\t * 记一条迟到子单死信。主键幂等：重复扫描同一条只落一次，返回是否真的新插入。\n 260→\t * 死信**只增不改**：它记的是\"结果无处可去\"这个事实，怎么处置是人看完再定的事。\n 261→\t */\n 262→\trecordDeadLetter(\n 263→\t\tentry: { parentTicketId: string; childTicketId: string; childStatus: string; note: string },\n 264→\t): boolean {\n 265→"
